# --- project-specific notes -------------------------------------------------
# This repository is app/webapp ONLY. The workbook, the Python pipeline, the project
# documents and the archive stay out of version control deliberately (Eric, 2026-08-19):
# nothing outside this folder is needed to build or run the site.
#
# NOT ignored, and must stay that way:
#   src/data/catalogue.json    the catalogue the app renders
#   src/data/build-info.json   the "last updated" date and entity counts
# Both are generated OUTSIDE this repo by scripts/build_app_data.py, which needs Python
# and openpyxl. The host only runs `npm run build`, so it cannot regenerate them — if
# these were ignored, every deploy would ship a site with no data.

# Wrangler's local dev state and bundles: machine-specific, never part of the site.
.wrangler
